                                "example_id": "56c9b77e-dd69-469a-b217-e585e3d8f44c",
                                "sense_id": "a515556e-5b92-3c86-b5d4-f73ef9c192e0",
                                "text": "East of Bow Creek, the line ran to North Woolwich along the bank of the Thames, then entirely uninhabited marshland, without roads."
